      "external_id": "2098541719637950735",
      "url": "https://x.com/MGAldys4/status/2098541719637950735",
      "content": "I tested on 50MB / 300MB APKs.\nglobal search string xrefs\n50MB: 41x faster than jadx (ASC 493ms)\n300MB: 269x faster than jadx (ASC 1.79s)\n\nUnlike Jadx or garlic, it doesn’t focus on exporting full pseudocode. It treats the APK itself as the source and lets you access it directly. https://t.co/HR2HjHL9fU",
